+# Corpus fetching
+
+## Observed rate limit
+
+The repository does not retain the fetch logs or configuration needed to recover the
+per-domain rate limit that the corpus fetch actually hit. Consequently, the number of
+visits per window, the window length, and the cooldown after a breach are **unknown**.
+They are not inferred here from a provider's documented limits.
+
+## File hosts
+
+The corpus manifest records `raw.githubusercontent.com` as the host used to fetch the
+raw files. No CDN or mirror host used for file fetching is recorded elsewhere in this
+checkout, so no additional host can be stated reliably. (`grep.app` was used to locate
+candidate files, not to fetch the files themselves.)
